{
 "id": "056-buyuyunce-ne-olacagim",
 "lang": "en",
 "title": "What Will I Be When I Grow Up?",
 "theme": "Jobs and dreams",
 "blurb": "On Jobs Day, Dr Aslı comes to the class; the tools in her bag make Elif burst with curiosity. A stethoscope, a thermometer, a plaster... So what does Elif want to be when she grows up?",
 "voiceNames": {
  "elif": "Elif",
  "asli": "Dr Aslı",
  "nur": "Miss Nur"
 },
 "pages": [
  {
   "text": "Today is Jobs Day! Miss Nur said: “Tell us what you'll be when you grow up.” Elif thought. She had no idea! Knock knock! Dr Aslı came through the door. She was holding a red bag.",
   "hits": {
    "elif": {
     "say": "Whirr! What's in the bag?"
    },
    "asli": {
     "say": "Hello, children! I'm Dr Aslı."
    },
    "nur": {
     "say": "What will you be when you grow up?"
    },
    "canta": {
     "say": "Clickety-clack! There's something inside!"
    }
   },
   "hint": "Touch the bag!",
   "ask": "Why do you think Elif is thinking so hard? What's in Dr Aslı's bag?",
   "cues": [
    {
     "w": 22,
     "fx": "kapi-tik"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Dr Aslı opened the bag. “What's this? And what's this?” A stethoscope, a thermometer, a plaster! Elif asked: “Where did you learn to use these?” Dr Aslı laughed: “At school! I studied for years.”",
   "hits": {
    "elif": {
     "say": "Where did you learn to use these?"
    },
    "asli": {
     "say": "At school! I studied for years."
    },
    "st": {
     "say": "A stethoscope. It listens to your heart."
    },
    "tm": {
     "say": "A thermometer. It takes your temperature. Beep beep!"
    },
    "yb": {
     "say": "A plaster. It covers a scrape."
    }
   },
   "hint": "Touch the tools!",
   "ask": "Which of these tools have you seen when you went to the doctor?"
  },
  {
   "text": "Elif picked up the stethoscope. The end was cool, so cool! “Now, what shall I listen to?” Dr Aslı winked: “Go on, try it!”",
   "hits": {
    "elif": {
     "say": "Now, what shall I listen to?"
    },
    "asli": {
     "say": "Go on, try it!"
    },
    "nur": {
     "say": "Will you ask me before you listen?"
    }
   },
   "predict": {
    "q": "What do you think Elif will listen to?",
    "res": "Let's see!",
    "opts": [
     {
      "l": "Her own heart"
     },
     {
      "l": "The teacher's heart"
     }
    ]
   },
   "hint": "Touch Elif!",
   "ask": "Have you ever heard your heart? What does it sound like?"
  },
  {
   "text": "Thump thump, thump thump! Elif heard her own heart. Then the first patient arrived: Fluffy the teddy bear! His knee was scraped. Dr Aslı whispered: “Heart first, then temperature. Wash the scrape, and the plaster last.”",
   "hits": {
    "elif": {
     "say": "Fluffy, may I listen to you?"
    },
    "asli": {
     "say": "Well done, Dr Elif, one step at a time!"
    },
    "pofuduk": {
     "say": "Fluffy is waiting patiently. His knee is sore."
    },
    "st": {
     "say": "Thump thump!"
    },
    "tm": {
     "say": "Beep beep! No fever."
    },
    "yb": {
     "say": "Snap! The plaster is on his knee."
    }
   },
   "mech": {
    "done": "Thump thump, beep beep, snap! Fluffy is getting better.",
    "msg": "You did the check-up in order!"
   },
   "hint": "Touch the stethoscope first!",
   "ask": "What did Elif do first when she checked Fluffy? What did she do next?"
  },
  {
   "text": "Miss Nur brought a basket. Inside were a paintbrush, a watering can and a great big wooden spoon. “These are tools for other jobs. Which is the painter's, which is the gardener's, which is the cook's?” Elif rolled up her sleeves.",
   "hits": {
    "elif": {
     "say": "Which goes where? Found it!"
    },
    "nur": {
     "say": "Let every tool find its job!"
    }
   },
   "mech": {
    "done": "Brush to the painting, can to the flower, spoon to the soup!",
    "msg": "Every tool found its job!"
   },
   "hint": "Touch the tool, then its job!",
   "ask": "Who uses a paintbrush, a watering can, a wooden spoon? What other jobs do you know?"
  },
  {
   "text": "Miss Nur asked: “Elif, what will you be when you grow up?” Elif thought and thought. She lifted down the flowerpots. She pressed the stethoscope to one. “Shhh! This flower is thirsty, its head is drooping. I'll be a flower doctor!”",
   "hits": {
    "elif": {
     "say": "I'll be a flower doctor!"
    },
    "cicek": {
     "say": "Shhh! This flower is thirsty."
    },
    "nur": {
     "say": "What will you be when you grow up?"
    }
   },
   "hint": "Listen to the flower!",
   "ask": "What do you want to be when you grow up? What tools would you use for that job?"
  },
  {
   "text": "Elif watered the flowers one by one. Splish splash! The flowers stood up straight, and their leaves shone. Dr Aslı smiled, Miss Nur clapped. What will she be when she grows up? A flower doctor! She has already started work.",
